 metal, the precious metals we're buying have some pass-through mechanism, whether it's in the assembly business, where directly passed through or we have the ability to pass-through some of the price increase to customers with a short lag.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/element-solutions-inc-esi-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"ESI 2020 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2020-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"And we've seen that actually in the sales line because, as you know, we passed through a lot of that metal price, and its reported as sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/element-solutions-inc-esi-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"ESI 2020 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"This was a product of improved mix, which contributed approximately 180 basis points as the business is more impacted by coronavirus, our industrial and assembly units, our lower margin and of cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/element-solutions-inc-esi-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"ESI 2020 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Cost savings in the quarter reflect both the carryover savings from actions we took in the second half of last year and additional savings associated with the current business environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/element-solutions-inc-esi-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"ESI 2020 Q4","e":"esi","d":"2021-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Where we've been taking price and our position to continue to take price is really where raw material inflation has impacted us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/element-solutions-inc-esi-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ESI 2020 Q4","e":"esi","d":"2021-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"So we have passed through dynamics in our assembly business and some of the metals that aren't on a direct pass-through basis we're surcharging for.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/element-solutions-inc-esi-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ESI 2021 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Both FX translation and pass-through metal pricing positively impacted our net sales results by 4% and 5%, respectively.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/element-solutions-inc-esi-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ESI 2021 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Volume and mix drove positive margins, partially offset by an increase in pass-through metals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/element-solutions-inc-esi-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ESI 2021 Q2","e":"esi","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Many raw materials have seen meaningful price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/element-solutions-inc-esi-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ESI 2021 Q2","e":"esi","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Our adjusted EBITDA margin was 27.8%, excluding the impact of the $107 million of pass-through metal sales in our Assembly Solutions business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/element-solutions-inc-esi-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ESI 2021 Q2","e":"esi","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"But this is not a cost savings exercise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/element-solutions-inc-esi-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ESI 2025 Q2","e":"esi","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Global trade dynamics remain volatile, and there's still a lack of clarity around tariff policy and its resulting impact on demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/esi-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2025 Q2","e":"esi","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"We continue to execute on mitigation efforts to minimize the impact of tariffs on our cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/esi-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2025 Q2","e":"esi","d":"2025-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Carey J. Dorman","x":"ESI's adjusted EBITDA margin declined roughly 40 basis points year-over-year in constant currency terms, largely impacted by higher pass-through metal prices relative to the same quarter of last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/esi-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2025 Q2","e":"esi","d":"2025-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Carey J. Dorman","x":"Excluding the impact of roughly $113 million pass-through metal sales and Assembly Solutions, our adjusted EBITDA margin would have been just under 27%, a 30 basis point improvement year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/esi-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2025 Q4","e":"esi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carey Dorman","x":"Net sales increased 10% organically, led by high-end electronics growth, primarily from AI and data center investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/element-solutions-esi-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2025 Q4","e":"esi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carey Dorman","x":"The Circuitry business has been a large beneficiary of AI-related investment as our market-leading pulse plating chemistry is used to support fabrication of high layer count server boards.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/element-solutions-esi-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2025 Q4","e":"esi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Carey Dorman","x":"Higher pass-through metals in our Assembly business created an optical margin headwind of roughly 1% in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/element-solutions-esi-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2025 Q4","e":"esi","d":"2026-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Carey Dorman","x":"Excluding net sales from these pass-through metals, adjusted EBITDA margin would have been 25.5%, representing a 40 basis point improvement year-on-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/element-solutions-esi-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2026 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Sales in our Electronics segment grew 15% organically as activity accelerated across our supply chain in support of the ongoing AI infrastructure build-out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/esi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2026 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Semiconductor Solutions organic net sales grew 18% due in part to improved order patterns for power electronics products at legacy customers and growing momentum in the thermal interface products for high power consumption applications such as AI GPU and CPUs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/esi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2026 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2026-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"As was the case with tariffs last year, there may also be opportunities where our competition may not have the same flexibility, geographic breadth and access to capital that we enjoy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/esi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2026 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"We delivered double-digit organic sales growth for the second quarter in a row and strong margin expansion, excluding the impact of pass-through metals, all while increasing investment in people, technology and plants to support customer growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/esi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2026 Q1","e":"esi","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Benjamin Gliklich","x":"Beginning this quarter, we are updating our definition of adjusted EBITDA margin to remove the value of pass-through metals sold in the period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/esi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2026 Q3","e":"esi","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carey Dorman","x":"Semiconductor Solutions organic net sales grew 24%, with improved order patterns for power electronics products and growing momentum in thermal interface materials for high power consumption applications such as AI GPUs and CPUs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/element-solutions-esi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2026 Q3","e":"esi","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carey Dorman","x":"Demand was strong for high-reliability solder paste in Asia, which are benefiting from growth in AI power supply, and for preformed products for data center applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/element-solutions-esi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ESI 2026 Q3","e":"esi","d":"2026-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Carey Dorman","x":"Adjusted EBITDA margins, excluding pass-through metals, improved 50 basis points year-over-year to 28.2% this quarter.","url